    "status": "present",
    "value": "You are given a chemical formula as a string. An element name is one uppercase letter optionally followed by lowercase letters. Any element may be followed by a count of two or more; a missing count means one. Formulas can be concatenated, and a parenthesised sub-formula may be followed by a count that multiplies everything inside it. Return a string listing every element in alphabetical order, each followed by its total count, with the count left out when it is exactly one."
  },
